(General Information for All Users) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Apex Global Bank on the Finova Platform) Tj T*
(Document ID: GEN-INF-001 | Version 1.0 | Owner: Customer Experience) Tj T*
(Illustrative information for the Finova demo workspace. Not legal or regulatory advice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. About Finova) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Finova is the digital banking and operations platform used by Apex Global Bank. Customers use) Tj T*
(it to view accounts, cards, transactions and support tickets. Bank staff use it for operations) Tj T*
(dashboards, fraud monitoring, support and compliance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Using the Website) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Sign in with your registered email and password. Your role decides which pages and data you) Tj T*
(can see.) Tj T*
(- The left sidebar lists the pages available to your role.) Tj T*
(- The Finova AI Assistant answers questions about the topics allowed for your role, using live) Tj T*
(data and the bank's policy documents.) Tj T*
(- Use the date filter \(30D, 90D, YTD, All History\) at the top of dashboards to change the) Tj T*
(reporting period.) Tj T*
(- Sign out after every session on a shared device.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Contact and Service Hours) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Customer care: available 24x7 through the Support page in the Finova app.) Tj T*
(- Branch banking hours: Monday to Saturday, 9:30 to 16:30 IST, except second and fourth) Tj T*
(Saturdays and public holidays.) Tj T*
(- Lost or stolen card: block it immediately from the Cards page, then raise an Urgent support) Tj T*
(ticket.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Documents Needed to Open an Account) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- PAN card \(mandatory\).) Tj T*
(- One proof of identity: Aadhaar, passport, voter ID or driving licence.) Tj T*
(- One proof of address: Aadhaar, passport, a utility bill from the last 3 months, or a) Tj T*
(registered rent agreement.) Tj T*
(- A recent photograph and a video-KYC or in-person verification.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Reporting an Unauthorised Transaction) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Report it immediately through Support or by blocking the card in the app.) Tj T*
(- If you report within 3 working days, your liability is zero once the claim is validated.) Tj T*
(- The disputed amount is usually credited back within 10 working days while the review) Tj T*
(continues.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Staying Safe) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- The bank will never ask for your PIN, CVV, OTP or full card number by phone, email or chat.) Tj T*
(- Only use the official Finova app or website.) Tj T*
(- If a transaction is held, you will see the message "Your transaction is under routine) Tj T*
(review.") Tj T*
ET
